From e8a00886e4d6a4d9ab1bcb058428b6a9edda8bd8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Witold=20Gre=C5=84?= <witold.gren@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:58:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ws: refresh the SD card list with only what is new since the
 last search

Each time a dashboard opened the list, the whole card was searched again, a year of days:
3.5 minutes with a battery camera awake over 4G, and copies asked for meanwhile waited
behind it. Within a day of the last full search a refresh now asks only for the time since
the last search and keeps the rest of the list; a full search still runs once a day.
